{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/firstone.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Star Scum fuses deckbuilding roguelikes with a nailbiting, chess-like tactical strategy game where every move matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/yourcards.png?t=1744734679\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Star Scum, building your deck is just the beginning! When you play cards in battle, they become tactical units and ship equipment like weapons and shields that you must command every turn across two battling ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/units.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/yourship1.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tiles of your ship define your stats, like health, amount of moves per turn and how much power you can generate. Customize your ship and buy new ones as you travel  into The Vortex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/ships.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/yourcards3.png?t=1744734679\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Almost every one of the hundreds of cards in the game has a unique special that provides countless ways to synergize with your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/cards.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/ways.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Star Scum is designed from the ground up as a game system that not only works as a singleplayer roguelike, but can also be played against other people. The game will launch with a ranked multiplayer server where you can take your decks against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the singleplayer Skirmish mode, design your decks from all the cards in the game and play against procedurally generated AI decks. Or watch two decks go at it in the Autobattler mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/end.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is built as a flexible card engine with mods and updates in mind that allows for easy creation of community-driven content.\u00a0 We can't wait to see what new ways to play the community discovers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2886700?t=1744734679","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744734679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/2041862ffc06cfaed43eca051d005f4ec85e010e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744734679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/2041862ffc06cfaed43eca051d005f4ec85e010e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744734679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/firstone.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Star Scum fuses deckbuilding roguelikes with a nailbiting, chess-like tactical strategy game where every move matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/yourcards.png?t=1744734679\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Star Scum, building your deck is just the beginning! When you play cards in battle, they become tactical units and ship equipment like weapons and shields that you must command every turn across two battling ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/units.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/yourship1.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tiles of your ship define your stats, like health, amount of moves per turn and how much power you can generate. Customize your ship and buy new ones as you travel  into The Vortex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/ships.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/yourcards3.png?t=1744734679\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Almost every one of the hundreds of cards in the game has a unique special that provides countless ways to synergize with your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/cards.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/ways.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Star Scum is designed from the ground up as a game system that not only works as a singleplayer roguelike, but can also be played against other people. The game will launch with a ranked multiplayer server where you can take your decks against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the singleplayer Skirmish mode, design your decks from all the cards in the game and play against procedurally generated AI decks. Or watch two decks go at it in the Autobattler mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/end.png?t=1744734679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is built as a flexible card engine with mods and updates in mind that allows for easy creation of community-driven content.\u00a0 We can't wait to see what new ways to play the community discovers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Soft Realm"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/header.jpg?t=1744734679","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04 LTS or similar<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB+ Video Memory, Vulkan-capable video card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<str